## Conclusion

The Self Bot v1.0 implementation is nearly complete, with the core functionality in place. The main pending task is obtaining a fresh SSID and validating the WebSocket connection to Pocket Option. Once this is done, the bot can be deployed to the EC2 instance and tested for stability.

The project follows a well-structured development plan with clear milestones and tasks. The current implementation provides a solid foundation for future enhancements in v1.5 and beyond.

